<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
  Replaces the dependency archive assigned to an AutoForge project version from Jenkins Pipeline.
  Required parameters: <code>baseUrl</code>, <code>apiKey</code>, <code>projectId</code>,
  <code>version</code>, <code>dependencyUrl</code>, <code>sha256</code>, and <code>sizeBytes</code>.
  Optional parameters: <code>fileName</code> and <code>archiveFormat</code> (ZIP defaults apply).
</div>
